        {
          "id": "step-1-c2",
          "file": "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/BranchPicker.svelte",
          "startLine": 320,
          "endLine": 326,
          "side": "new",
          "body": "onmouseenter={preloadPRs} on the Pull Requests tab trigger — bits-ui forwards the handler to the underlying button, so hovering warms the list before the click."
